{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An ISEKAI, RPG, CRAFTING GAME!?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and your best friend got transported to another world!! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Obtain Skills that give you resistances, strengths, allow you mine, allow you to build, use crazy fighting moves, synthesize items from nova, craft anything and even fly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battles are Turn Based with attack patterns, physically, you are weak, but you have found mysterious shields of dark and light that can block any attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Block any attack in 6 directions with WASDQE and IJKLUO controlling Kurome and Ensho separately. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a heavily vertical 3D world from a comfortable 2D top down perspective, the skies and underground are not out of reach!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world gets more extreme and violent the further away from the plains you travel thanks to the force called &quot;nova&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sadism is rampant in this world where anyone can level up, how will you influence this world with your power?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your actions will effect everyone in this new world...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3201040?t=1742954916","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3201040?t=1742954916","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201040/7b55fd6382ada97defe2a663d7dee21e9b96aa0f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742954916","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201040/7b55fd6382ada97defe2a663d7dee21e9b96aa0f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742954916","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Themes of violence and sadism.\r\nDepictions of gore alongside death."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An ISEKAI, RPG, CRAFTING GAME!?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You and your best friend got transported to another world!! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Obtain Skills that give you resistances, strengths, allow you mine, allow you to build, use crazy fighting moves, synthesize items from nova, craft anything and even fly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battles are Turn Based with attack patterns, physically, you are weak, but you have found mysterious shields of dark and light that can block any attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Block any attack in 6 directions with WASDQE and IJKLUO controlling Kurome and Ensho separately. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a heavily vertical 3D world from a comfortable 2D top down perspective, the skies and underground are not out of reach!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world gets more extreme and violent the further away from the plains you travel thanks to the force called &quot;nova&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sadism is rampant in this world where anyone can level up, how will you influence this world with your power?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your actions will effect everyone in this new world...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Stenblood"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3201040/72a288c6414293a7d7b5586633342ac0f61356c3/heade